# StudyDate Product

StudyDate is a study-partner matching platform for university students.

Core features:
- Student learning profiles
- Study-partner recommendations
- Structured Study Requests
- Anonymous chat
- Study session scheduling
- Telegram Bot integration
- Mutual contact reveal
- Report, block, and safety controls

# Technology

- Next.js App Router
- TypeScript with strict mode
- Tailwind CSS
- Supabase Auth, PostgreSQL, Storage, and Realtime
- Server Components by default
- Client Components only when interactivity is required

